                <h2 class="fw-bold mb-3">Complete Individual Pig & Breeding Herd Management</h2>
                <p class="text-muted">
                    Maintain rigorous individual animal traceability for farrow-to-finish operations. Track breeding boars, sows, growers, and piglets with individual RFID/ear-tag tracking.
                </p>
                <div class="row g-3 mt-2">
                    <div class="col-sm-6">
                        <div class="d-flex gap-3">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-tag text-success fs-5 mt-1"></i>
                            <div>
                                <h6 class="fw-bold m-0">Unique Tag Identification</h6>
                                <small class="text-muted">Lifecycle tracking from farrowing to market finish.</small>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-sm-6">
                        <div class="d-flex gap-3">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-weight-scale text-success fs-5 mt-1"></i>
                            <div>
                                <h6 class="fw-bold m-0">Weight & Feed Curves</h6>
                                <small class="text-muted">Monitor daily gain curves and feed efficiency.</small>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-sm-6">
                        <div class="d-flex gap-3">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-dna text-success fs-5 mt-1"></i>
                            <div>
                                <h6 class="fw-bold m-0">Pedigree & Genetics</h6>
                                <small class="text-muted">Sire and Dam lineage mapping for breed vigor.</small>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-sm-6">
                        <div class="d-flex gap-3">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-bed-pulse text-success fs-5 mt-1"></i>
                            <div>
                                <h6 class="fw-bold m-0">Quarantine Pen Logs</h6>
                                <small class="text-muted">Strict bio-isolation for newly introduced or sick pigs.</small>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-4">
