                            </div>
                            <span class="badge bg-primary">Automated HVAC</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Biosecurity Features Section (6 Pillars) -->
<section class="py-5 bg-light border-top border-bottom" id="biosecurity">
    <div class="container py-4">
        <div class="text-center mb-5">
            <span class="badge bg-success bg-opacity-10 text-success fw-bold px-3 py-2 text-uppercase mb-2">The Core Defense Framework</span>
            <h2 class="fw-bold">6-Pillar Digital Biosecurity System</h2>
            <p class="text-muted mx-auto" style="max-width: 700px;">
                FarmShield operationalizes the six internationally recognized biosecurity pillars defined by WOAH (World Organisation for Animal Health) and FAO into executable digital workflows.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="row g-4">
            <!-- Pillar A -->
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                <div class="stat-card h-100">
                    <div class="stat-icon green mb-3">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-id-card-clip"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h5 class="fw-bold">A. Visitor & Gate Security</h5>
                    <p class="text-muted small">
                        Mandatory visitor registration, 72-hour previous farm contact verification, PPE distribution, vehicle undercarriage tire spray, and gate pass approvals.
                    </p>
                    <a asp-controller="Biosecurity" asp-action="Visitors" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-success">Manage Gate <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ms-1"></i></a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Pillar B -->
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                <div class="stat-card h-100">
                    <div class="stat-icon blue mb-3">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-pump-soap"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h5 class="fw-bold">B. Cleaning & Disinfection</h5>
                    <p class="text-muted small">
                        Daily sanitation schedules, chemical brand & dilution monitoring (Virkon, Glutaraldehyde), terminal barn wash logs, and footbath solution refreshment.
                    </p>
                    <a asp-controller="Biosecurity" asp-action="Cleaning" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary">Cleaning Logs <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ms-1"></i></a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Pillar C -->
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                <div class="stat-card h-100">
                    <div class="stat-icon red mb-3">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-heart-pulse"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h5 class="fw-bold">C. Health & Quarantine</h5>
                    <p class="text-muted small">
                        Daily herd surveillance, early symptom detection, bio-quarantine pen isolation, and veterinary confirmation protocols to prevent horizontal pathogen spread.
                    </p>
                    <a asp-controller="Diseases" asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger">Surveillance <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ms-1"></i></a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Pillar D -->
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                <div class="stat-card h-100">
                    <div class="stat-icon green mb-3">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-faucet-drip"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h5 class="fw-bold">D. Feed & Water Safety</h5>
                    <p class="text-muted small">
                        Testing bulk feed consignments for moisture and mycotoxin mold, automated waterline chlorination (2-4 ppm), pH adjustment, and bacterial testing.
                    </p>
                    <a asp-controller="Biosecurity" asp-action="FeedWater" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-success">Feed & Water <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ms-1"></i></a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Pillar E -->
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                <div class="stat-card h-100">
                    <div class="stat-icon orange mb-3">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-bug-slash"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h5 class="fw-bold">E. Pest & Vector Control</h5>
                    <p class="text-muted small">
                        Mapped exterior rodent bait stations, insect fogging schedules, fly larvae treatment in manure pits, and wild-bird exclusion screen inspections.
                    </p>
                    <a asp-controller="Biosecurity" asp-action="PestControl" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-warning">IPM Records <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ms-1"></i></a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Pillar F -->
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                <div class="stat-card h-100">
                    <div class="stat-icon red mb-3">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-dumpster-fire"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h5 class="fw-bold">F. Waste & Carcass Disposal</h5>
                    <p class="text-muted small">
                        Sanitary carcass containment within 12 hours via high-temperature incineration or thermophilic composting (65°C+), and slurry lagoon leachate monitoring.
                    </p>
                    <a asp-controller="Biosecurity" asp-action="WasteManagement" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger">Waste Logs <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ms-1"></i></a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Benefits Section -->
